{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39096","headline":"柳谷道中作却寄 · 韦庄","name":"柳谷道中作却寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马前红叶正纷纷，马上离情断杀魂。\n晓发独辞残月店，暮程遥宿隔云村。\n心如岳色留秦地，梦逐河声出禹门。\n莫怪苦吟鞭拂地，有谁倾盖待王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}